{'symbol': 'CTLT', 'date': '2022-12-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'CATALENT ANNOUNCES CHANGES TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "SOMERSET, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--CATALENT, INC. (NYSE: CTLT), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN ENABLING PHARMA, BIOTECH, AND CONSUMER HEALTH PARTNERS TO OPTIMIZE DEVELOPMENT, LAUNCH, AND SUPPLY OF BETTER PATIENT TREATMENTS ACROSS MULTIPLE MODALITIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CURRENT BOARD MEMBER AND LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR J. MARTIN (“MARTY”) CARROLL HAS BEEN UNANIMOUSLY SELECTED BY ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS TO SUCCEED JOHN CHIMINSKI AND SERVE AS CHAIR FOLLOWING MR. CHIMINSKI'S RETIREMENT."}